# Push to GitHub

After each product change, commit and push to `origin` (`https://github.com/hiddevanbrussel/casehub.git`) unless the user explicitly says not to.

- Push `main` to `origin` only. Never push the leftover `casesystem` remote.
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `data/`.
- Do not force-push `main`.
- Do not skip git hooks.
